      "title": "Payments API v2 — release week",
      "description": "Shipping the v2 endpoints behind a flag: PR queue, rollout plan, risk register and the questions still open with the platform team.",
      "dueInDays": 4,
      "brief": "## Payments API v2 — release week\n\n**Team** Checkout platform · 4 engineers\n**Release** @+4d behind `payments_v2` flag, 5% → 25% → 100%\n**Rollback** flag off, no migration to reverse\n\n### What ships\n- `POST /v2/payments` with idempotency keys enforced server-side\n- Webhook signatures move from HMAC-SHA1 to HMAC-SHA256\n- Retry semantics documented and tested against the sandbox\n\n### Definition of done\n- p95 latency within 10% of v1 on the canary\n- Zero duplicate charges in the idempotency soak test\n- Partner docs published and the two pilot partners signed off\n\n### Where it stands\nSeven of eleven PRs merged. The idempotency store is the long pole — it needs the platform team's answer on TTLs before the soak test can run. **Everything else is on track for @+4d.**",
      "callout": {
        "title": "Blocking: idempotency key TTL",
        "body": "Platform team owes an answer on 24h vs 72h TTL. Soak test can't start without it, and the soak gates the 5% canary. Chasing at standup @+1d.",
        "accent": "#ef4444",
        "icon": "⚠️"
      },
