      "page": {
        "title": "Risk register",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "h3": "What could go wrong"
          },
          {
            "p": "Ranked by blast radius, not likelihood. Each one has an owner and a tripwire that pulls the flag."
          },
          {
            "h4": "1. Duplicate charges"
          },
          {
            "p": "If the idempotency store evicts early, a client retry can charge twice. **Tripwire:** any duplicate in the canary pages the on-call and flips the flag off automatically."
          },
          {
            "h4": "2. Webhook signature mismatch"
          },
          {
            "p": "Partners verifying with SHA1 will reject SHA256 payloads. Mitigation is the dual-sign window: both headers for 30 days."
          },
          {
            "h4": "3. Latency regression"
          },
          {
            "p": "The extra store lookup adds one round trip. Budget is +10% p95; the canary dashboard alarms at +8%."
          },
          {
            "h4": "Not a risk (checked)"
          },
          {
            "ul": [
              "No schema migration — v1 and v2 share tables",
              "No client SDK change required for v1 callers",
              "Rollback is a flag flip, under a minute"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
